<title>USA: Bank United Corp sets qtly div.</title>
<headline>Bank United Corp sets qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank United Corp said it set a class A dividend.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.14		     $0.14</p>
<p> Pay		  March 26</p>
<p> Record	     March 17</p>
